  "description": "Adaptive vault reader skill. Receives a natural language question, searches the vault first (Glob/Grep, entity reads, wikilink traversal), then self-assesses whether more context is needed. Escalates to /graphify for graph-level understanding or to /bedrock:teach for remote content ingestion only when the vault alone is insufficient. Answers simple questions with zero graphify calls. Use when: \"bedrock ask\", \"bedrock-ask\", \"/bedrock:ask\", any question about the vault, \"what do we know about\", \"who owns\", \"what's the status of\", \"tell me about\", \"how does it work\", or any Second Brain query.",
